            <div xml:id="m-886f4614-3ff4-45ba-8986-3c7c05ff27a4">
              <lg xml:id="m-717cdf9d-3c11-450f-b957-558f09f9579f">
                <l xml:id="m-c1e88f7c-f15b-46a2-aaad-e1703290966e" facs="#m-bc30de5f-4095-4cd0-a1ee-3a066f6a1732" label="text-like">The Circumcision of our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-f0fc91d3-a9e9-493a-bf49-79db0c916627" facs="#m-816cd7b3-ef7e-4afb-b544-3abc527bab30" label="ambiguous">442</l><l xml:id="m-81c4e77c-f112-48e8-a7ae-5f04425cf4f9" facs="#m-95bddfc0-dc3e-4868-91bc-40d670ed43db" label="lyrics-like">offertory. Tui sunt caéli- D. 410.</l><l xml:id="m-b8f86268-4186-4b5a-841e-c883c14601ac" facs="#m-99551139-4591-40c3-835c-01c6cad6584f" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-2e71fa3c-5ee2-49a5-bba1-8b437ff1cf18" facs="#m-6d2ce4e4-b2de-4339-a032-b10af8a18d67" label="lyrics-like">Unéribus nostris, quaésumus ]stériis, et cleménter exáudi. Per</l><l xml:id="m-10800f24-1aca-4e9c-9de9-274e7399fa12" facs="#m-d3eb94ac-8861-41c1-ae10-47db65e04dfc" label="lyrics-like">51t Dómine, precibúsque suscé-lDóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-48fbc14e-20af-4a6c-97fa-ace0664729d6" facs="#m-edd849cc-2c40-4cb8-a155-ee6347af24be" label="lyrics-like">ptis : et caeléstibus nos munda my¬</l><l xml:id="m-dc0a3664-2ff9-42b5-8956-ad13b91163ae" facs="#m-5fd0428a-e7bb-4d54-b080-bf050937bc7e" label="lyrics-like">Commanton. Vidérunt. p. 410.</l><l xml:id="m-579a2bc2-567f-46e5-8e3a-34ab38b99353" facs="#m-ce5abf3d-eb7e-46dd-a6cd-d0905c282871" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-e6bc07cf-4c74-4826-9a29-5e0410fe0f84" facs="#m-fe9061ec-cb16-4e86-ac5a-24c616b4eab0" label="lyrics-like">«Aec nos commúnio, Dómine, 1María, caeléstis remédii fáciat ese</l><l xml:id="m-8a95e48c-3f64-4a84-9045-3c54a3aeb315" facs="#m-7af9e58e-bae9-4e01-9764-818946cd18fc" label="ambiguous">It purget a crimine: et interce¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5f37002-19b0-49e2-aecd-f1c5fe0550eb" facs="#m-db39aa88-619d-433e-920d-f8d0d15b39f3" label="lyrics-like">consórtes. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2c9aca43-50bc-40db-9388-0c7234deb781" facs="#m-65d004a1-7eb5-4813-8102-441e41aa3396" label="ambiguous">dente beata Virgine Dei Genitrice</l><l xml:id="m-fe669757-06b5-4205-ad28-2018faaf266c" facs="#m-1b85945d-574f-4492-af92-4bd2a6769d1c" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-667181d6-89fc-4cc0-9270-b1d3f38d84b5" facs="#m-4ebc149c-6415-4fdf-a4e1-7f0cb8b8dc29" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Rúbum quem víderat. p. 443.</l><l xml:id="m-ca317d1e-b6b0-40d2-87ba-4f6be1f52bc7" facs="#m-17eeadd7-adbb-44a1-871d-5280543747af" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-68a523bb-6db7-41b7-a636-4f25b8ad44f8" facs="#m-f0334861-8f24-4d4c-a2d1-b9ce9e3e29a4" label="ambiguous">Heb. 1. c.</l><l xml:id="m-9bf8b90a-4d71-4688-bfca-06cccc2afb82" facs="#m-72e46463-5138-4d69-baca-6191cc9d33a0" label="lyrics-like">T: Tu in principio Dómine ter- nuum tuárum sunt caeli¬</l><l xml:id="m-084f4ada-bbc9-481b-b57a-e71a750a74d2" facs="#m-48212410-cb2d-49e3-91eb-cd08655bff09" label="lyrics-like">Lram fundásti :“* et ópera má¬</l><l xml:id="m-b11271ce-dc64-4d31-af07-67b18e8d9eab" facs="#m-14d7a872-c8bd-4b00-9923-320447cb80ec" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Nótum fécit. V. Vidérunt. D. Ai.</l><l xml:id="m-8c5d12b9-7636-4f0f-929f-b580de595046" facs="#m-530aca4b-b3af-487f-80ff-c42e25c62e57" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-08a646ff-9df7-4850-bfd7-a3dd03b286f7" facs="#m-572382d0-1411-4cd2-978d-736ec91f1b8b" label="ambiguous">Ant. Ecce Maria. D. 444.</l><l xml:id="m-1af566e3-f308-4423-8a6f-c81640475cdd" facs="#m-2fb6cf7d-246d-45a9-9e83-0eb38740495d" label="ambiguous">Heb. r. d.</l><l xml:id="m-795f2d79-b41d-4045-9da0-ee5f15857d56" facs="#m-e890f8d0-59d4-4a61-bda9-26cc71753f3f" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-8dc72d3f-cdf4-4440-8582-e7beaa221ba9" facs="#m-352d9eaf-f2ca-48f3-988d-24e9c8345836" label="lyrics-like">"Psi peribunt, tu autem permané-] mutábis eos, et mutabúntur: * tu</l><l xml:id="m-41e73751-0e49-47c1-be44-fb4c5dc0ed82" facs="#m-abac20fd-17d5-4e03-858b-5338a66cd178" label="lyrics-like">L bis: t et omnes sicut vestimén-autem idem ipse es, et anni tui non</l><l xml:id="m-327f9cdf-2380-4bbf-898c-73491b29abca" facs="#m-6d52b50f-d8fc-4fa8-9031-714c40398dd4" label="lyrics-like">tum veteráscent: et velut amictum deficient.</l><l xml:id="m-eb44c653-5dfe-4ac7-8f53-3911be49b849" facs="#m-8275526f-b4fd-47dd-a081-03321d740b9e" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Vidérunt ómnes. V. Vérbum cáro. p. 411.</l><l xml:id="m-15e9327f-65bf-4630-85f8-172f4fd584cd" facs="#m-f703a7d6-e61a-4127-8270-a2d4d47c746b" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-adaab586-ddb1-49ad-81e8-39371bbdc18e" facs="#m-64ec0d77-093c-41ec-a047-43a5e3f6f62b" label="lyrics-like">Paaims. 1. Díxit Dóminus. 6. F. p. 132. — 2. Laudáte púeri. 3. a 2.</l><l xml:id="m-90d2e9f7-0f2c-4c11-8093-ab0a188de486" facs="#m-4f46fd8c-81fe-4742-b9fe-bb51932d7e22" label="lyrics-like">». 149. — 3. Laetátus sum. 4. E. p. 171.— 4. Nisi Dóminus. I. f. 175.</l><l xml:id="m-77c28a2a-1170-471a-8eac-d9441aa5802f" facs="#m-e3e47cee-8f79-4a2f-b4aa-e7537fcbd18e" label="lyrics-like">— 5. Láuda Jerúsalem. 2. D. p. 203.</l><l xml:id="m-30b1cc11-099c-4822-a654-6e204c2e642f" facs="#m-8c797a53-dfa3-4373-b77e-2fa35e10c8fe" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-c6edd5e9-2e37-4d9b-94c6-7c4b954083ba" facs="#m-b4b1e5da-20d1-4348-a961-7eb61f3d273b" label="ambiguous">G.F</l><l xml:id="m-fc959b64-8ba0-45d5-b7f6-640f819da6ee" facs="#m-3383f417-49e7-4150-afd7-572f17f1f58a" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-7742da91-1601-45f2-8f7a-19c79ff7bd64" facs="#m-d590e76f-401a-4b5f-861e-6a3f466ca741" label="lyrics-like">admi-rábi-le commérci- um!“Cre-á-tor gé¬</l><l xml:id="m-374666ce-c28a-40fd-b1e9-1d0f0a14d452" facs="#m-21aedae9-017f-4368-ba2d-6f8801ec1efd" label="lyrics-like">ne-ris humáni, animá¬ tum córpus súmens, de Virgine</l><l xml:id="m-2f4c965d-a7e0-4664-ab01-ed46f64b32c8" facs="#m-324a8260-5658-4647-9ea0-a987c641e831" label="lyrics-like">násci digná¬ tus est: et procédens hómo si-ne sémine,</l></lg>
            </div>
